    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td rowspan="11" class="sideways gold" style="width: 10%">
            <div>Identify</div>
        </td>
        <td colspan="2" class="center gold">
            Asset Management
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td><mark class="supplementalHighlight">Establish and document policies and procedures for assessing and maintaining configuration information, for tracking changes  made to the pipeline cyber assets, and for patching/upgrading operating systems and applications.  Ensure that the changes do not adversely impact existing cybersecurity  controls.</mark></td>
